# Read by Flux's source-controller when it packs the GitRepository artifact, and applied after
# its built-in excludes. Those excludes drop every *.png, so config/branding's app icon never
# reached the cluster and glance-config failed to build on a file kustomize could see locally.
# Re-include it. Nothing else in the tree ships a binary Flux has to read.
!config/branding/**/*.png
